    "summary": "Public participation without invitation began September 30, 2026. Researcher-identified accounts, original human analysis and reproducible impact are required. Confirmed deletion of acquired member data is a reward condition. Platform first-valid-report rules apply; monetary compensation requires age 18 or the applicable age of majority.",
